@startuml
start
:Request SMS permission;
if (Permission granted?) then (yes)
  :Query inbox SMS (recent N);
  while (Each SMS?) is (yes)
    :Normalize sender/body;
    if (Sender in allowlist?) then (yes)
      if (OTP/Promo detected?) then (yes)
        :Reject SMS;
      else (no)
        if (Has txn keyword?) then (yes)
          if (Has amount pattern?) then (yes)
            :Build fingerprint
(sender|date|body);
            if (Fingerprint already processed?) then (yes)
              :Skip SMS;
            else (no)
              :Show in candidate list;
              if (User processes SMS?) then (yes)
                :Call parse API;
                if (HTTP 200/201?) then (yes)
                  :Persist fingerprint
(processed_sms_fingerprints_v1);
                  :Refresh finance data;
                else (no)
                  :Keep SMS retryable;
                endif
              endif
            endif
          else (no)
            :Reject SMS;
          endif
        else (no)
          :Reject SMS;
        endif
      endif
    else (no)
      :Reject SMS;
    endif
  endwhile (no)
else (no)
  :Show permission denied state;
endif
stop
@enduml
```

## Sequence Diagram (PlantUML)
```plantuml
@startuml
actor User
participant "SmsListScreen" as UI
participant "SmsPlatformMobile" as SP
database "SharedPreferences" as PREF
participant "SmsQuery" as INBOX
participant "API Service" as API

User -> UI: Open SMS screen
UI -> SP: requestSmsPermission()
SP --> UI: granted/denied

alt granted
  UI -> SP: getInboxSms()
  SP -> PREF: load processed fingerprints
  PREF --> SP: Set<String>
  SP -> INBOX: querySms(inbox, count=200)
  INBOX --> SP: List<SmsMessage>
  SP -> SP: apply allowlist + exclude + keyword + amount + dedupe
  SP --> UI: List<SmsEntry>

  User -> UI: Swipe to process SMS
  UI -> SP: callApi(SmsEntry)
  SP -> PREF: check fingerprint exists?
  alt already processed
    SP --> UI: success (skip API)
  else not processed
    SP -> API: parseSMS(familyId, smsBody)
    API --> SP: 200/201 or error
    alt 200/201
      SP -> PREF: save fingerprint
      SP --> UI: success
      UI -> UI: refresh finance data
    else error
      SP --> UI: failure (retry allowed)
    end
  end
else denied
  UI -> UI: Show permission status
end
@enduml
